
[l_english.FOCUS_C12_LAST_BASTION_OF_THE_RESISTANCE]
The Southern Bastion of the Resistance

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_LAST_BASTION_OF_THE_RESISTANCE_desc]
We, the three families, will not hesitate to join the resistance and actively take part in the war to liberate ourselves from the Empire. However, given the great distance between us and the command center of Our Town, we believe it would be wiser to petition for an independent formation and leadership core, so that we can more swiftly grasp changes on the battlefield and respond accordingly — and even preserve our remaining forces should the North fall into peril.

[l_english.FOCUS_C12_LAST_BASTION_OF_THE_RESISTANCE_TOOLTIP]
We will not directly join §C Equstria Resistance §! But we will fight side by side with them and help each other

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_LAST_BASTION_OF_THE_RESISTANCE]
抵抗阵线的南方壁垒

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_LAST_BASTION_OF_THE_RESISTANCE_desc]
我们三个家族将毫不犹豫的作为抵抗组织的一份子，积极参与对帝国的解放战争中，不过，鉴于平等镇指挥中心与我们之间的遥远距离，或许我们该请愿保持独立的编制和领导核心，从而方便我们更快洞悉战场局势并做出改变，并甚至在北方陷入危难中时仍可以保存有生力量。

[l_simp_chinese.FOCUS_C12_LAST_BASTION_OF_THE_RESISTANCE_TOOLTIP]
我们不会直接加入§C小马利亚抵抗组织§!但我们会与他们并肩作战、互帮互助
